            "review_title": "Review at Mama Pho",
            "review_text": "Travel Instinct\nSydney, Australia194 contributions\n0\nPhở that you'll come back for\nJun 2026 • Solo\nI was disappointed to find Mama Pho had closed its restaurant at LÊ THÁNH TÔN, near Ben Thanh Market, in late 2025 but the new restaurant near Bitexco Tower is every bit as good. It's the same friendly staff and the same great food. The soup and noodles here are up there with the best I’ve had in Saigon from a restaurant chain. Every bowl is authentic and fresh, and they use Australian beef. Yes, you can taste the difference. It's a little more cramped downstairs compared to the previous restaurant but I think it's more cosy. There's extra seating upstairs.\nRead more\nWritten September 22, 2026",
